  "description": "EARLY - not ready for real work yet.\n\n      NetTopologySuite made natural inside vvvv gamma. Build geometry from coordinates, measure\n      and validate it, run spatial operations on it, and read and write WKT.\n\n      The nodes hand back native NetTopologySuite types - Point, LineString, Polygon, Geometry -\n      not wrappers, so a geometry made here goes straight into anything else that speaks NTS,\n      including VL.Mapsui, and advanced users can reach the whole library through VL's raw .NET\n      nodes.\n\n      Requires vvvv gamma 7.2 or newer (.NET 8).",
  "id": "VL.NetTopologySuite",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-25T15:12:48.08Z",
