  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.1-alpha - The first release, a prerelease. 39 nodes in six categories - NTS.Geometry,\n      NTS.Feature, NTS.Operation, NTS.IO, NTS.Index, NTS.Network - 126 tests, 15 help patches, and\n      F1 on every node opens one. Verified in vvvv gamma 7.4. Coordinates are copied on the way in\n      and out, so a geometry cannot be moved behind your back. Not ready for real work: the node\n      surface may still change between prereleases.",
